# Fastlane match configuration — code-signing assets storage.
#
# match keeps the App Distribution certificate + App Store provisioning
# profiles for BOTH apps (com.tootiye.teka + com.tootiye.tekaseller) in one
# private git repo, encrypted with MATCH_PASSWORD. Bundle ids differ, so the
# two Apple teams' profiles coexist without collision.
#
# CI runs in READ-ONLY mode: it only clones + decrypts existing assets, never
# regenerates them (that's an operator's one-time local `fastlane match
# appstore` step — see docs/mobile-release.md). Read-only mode needs only git
# access (MATCH_GIT_URL) + MATCH_PASSWORD; it never touches the Apple API.
#
# git_url comes from the env so the PAT-authenticated URL
# (https://x-access-token:<PAT>@github.com/<org>/teka-ios-certs.git) stays out
# of the repo. app_identifier / type / team_id are passed per-lane in the
# Fastfile (they vary by app).
git_url(ENV["MATCH_GIT_URL"])
storage_mode("git")

type("appstore")
readonly(true)
